{
    "$schema": "https://go.kicad.org/pcm/schemas/v2",
    "name": "NFC Antenna Generator",
    "description": "按 NFC 布线规范一键生成 NFC/HF 天线封装并可一键放置到 PCB",
    "description_full": "输入匝数、尺寸、线宽、线距等参数，按 ST AN2972 与 KiCad 官方天线封装范式生成 NFC/HF(13.56MHz) 平面螺旋天线封装：天线铜箔用 F.Cu 实心多边形表达，两个焊盘用 net_tie_pad_groups 声明为同一导体，并给出电感/电阻/Q/谐振电容估算与布局校验。支持内侧端子（单层）与外侧双焊盘（B.Cu 过孔跨接）两种拓扑。兼容 KiCad 8.0 ~ 11。",
    "identifier": "com.github.YonimoC.kicad-nfc-antenna-generator",
    "type": "plugin",
    "author": {
        "name": "LWH",
        "contact": {
            "web": "https://github.com/YonimoC/kicad-nfc-antenna-generator"
        }
    },
    "license": "MIT",
    "resources": {
        "homepage": "https://github.com/YonimoC/kicad-nfc-antenna-generator"
    },
    "versions": [
        {
            "version": "1.1.0",
            "status": "stable",
            "kicad_version": "8.0",
            "kicad_version_max": "11.99",
            "runtime": "swig",
            "install_size": 40000
        }
    ]
}
